Remove the bank the preset test saves

The "preset handling" test writes Effects/saved.rpl with ysfx_save_bank()
and never deletes it, so the scoped Effects directory cannot be removed
afterwards. With Catch 3 the serialization, integration and parse tests
run later and each fails creating Effects with "mkdir: File exists". A
scoped file declared before the save deletes it with the others.

Upstream: not submitted
Applies-to: all environments

diff --git a/tests/ysfx_test_preset.cpp b/tests/ysfx_test_preset.cpp
index a851cc7..3f3286f 100644
--- a/tests/ysfx_test_preset.cpp
+++ b/tests/ysfx_test_preset.cpp
@@ -606,6 +606,8 @@ TEST_CASE("preset handling", "[preset]")
         
         scoped_new_dir dir_fx("${root}/Effects");
         scoped_new_txt file_rpl("${root}/Effects/test.rpl", rpl_text);
+        // ysfx_save_bank() below overwrites it; this removes it afterwards.
+        scoped_new_txt file_saved("${root}/Effects/saved.rpl", "");
 
         ysfx_bank_u bank{ysfx_load_bank(file_rpl.m_path.c_str())};
         std::string stored_bank = ysfx_save_bank_to_rpl_text(bank.get());
